	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"「ガンプラバトル・ネクサスオンライン」でNPD（Non Player Diver）として、様々なバトルに登場する「リーオーNPD」が、多種多様なバリエーションパーツとともに立体化！",
			"• 差替え頭部4種、肩アーマー3種が付属し、様々な組み合わせでカスタマイズが可能！",
			"• バックパックはパーツを外すことでジョイント穴が出現し、他のガンプラのバックパックも装備できる！"
		],
		"en": [
			"\"Leo NPD\", who appears in various battles as an NPD (Non Player Diver) in \"Gunpla Battle Nexus Online\", is now three-dimensional with a wide variety of variation parts!",
			"• Comes with 4 types of replaceable heads and 3 types of shoulder armor, allowing you to customize it with various combinations!",
			"• By removing parts of the backpack, a joint hole will appear, allowing you to equip other Gunpla backpacks as well!"
		]
